Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.60,1:08:15.50,Note,,0,0,0,,(爸爸)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.90,1:08:34.90,Note,,0,0,0,,(妈妈)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.60,1:08:39.90,Note,,0,0,0,,(奶奶)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.60,1:08:44.90,Note,,0,0,0,,(大伯)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,水叮当就像在水里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agua, as in water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱但是我来这儿并不是为了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cute. But I wasn't here for cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是因为收到定期缴费通知 才来这儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was here 'cause I'd gotten a call for my regular fee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,4.99美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$4.99.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个超级特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an ex-secret agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫朱尼·克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Juni Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.02,0:01:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也是个私家侦探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm a private detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.59,0:01:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A.P.I.私家侦探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A P.I. A private eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,胶鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gumshoe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.39,0:01:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道为什么你家公园会没水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know why the water from your park is missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请说 - 冬天到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pray tell. - It's winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在冬天关闭了公园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shut down the park during the winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's "they"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真正拥有这座公园的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people who really own this park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,世道不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Times are tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是一个人必须去做 他该做的事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a guy's gotta do what he's gotta do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:02:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从拯救树上的猫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From saving cats in trees...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,到寻找遗失的玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to finding lost toys,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助别人… 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to helping people... Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,欧斯找我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The OSS is looking for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,听着我已经不再是个特工了 我帮不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm no longer an agent. I can't help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样那是你的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, it's your problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别烦我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave me alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我被欧斯公司骗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd been burned by the agency. The OSS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我一去不回头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I left. No going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我处理我自己的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I handle my own assignments now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,规模小了一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smaller in scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在保留实力等着办大案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was saving up for something big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我排队站着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was standing in line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,等候要买史上最大的模拟游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to buy my copy of the biggest virtual-reality game in history..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,它在午夜才能玩非常刺激大概吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It goes online at midnight. Pretty exciting, I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,目前有史以来最大的电玩游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The biggest video game to ever be created, period.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个轰动世界性大事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a worldwide event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只知道是个玩具制造商开发了这个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game was created by someone known only as the Toymaker,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人从不接受采访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was once again unavailable for interviews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在有比游戏更重要的事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there 's gotta be some things more important than games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,噢我们刚有提到凡是连过五关者…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and did we mention the surprises the Toymaker has in store{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具制造商在店里所提供的惊喜吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for those of you that complete level five?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,数不清的财富 玩具和奖品 超乎你的想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Untold riches, toys, and prizes beyond your wildest dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 别插队 怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, no cutting in line, freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我没插队我就在这儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't cutting. I was standing right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,排最后面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End of the line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不用说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Needless to say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我离开欧斯以后事情变得碍手碍脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}things have been pretty lame since I left the OSS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,事情即将变得更糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things were about to get worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Juni,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我作了点东西我想你会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was doing some work and thought you might like these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,迷你鲨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miniaturized sharks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.05,0:04:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,记住他们还是会吃人的 所以千万别把你的手指放进鱼缸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, they're still man-eaters, so don 't be poking your fingers in the bowl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,保重如果需要帮助的话我会赶来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care. If you guys ever need anything, I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,罗梅罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拉尔夫回封感谢函 给罗梅罗吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ralph , write a thank-you note back to Romero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,乖一点各位别打架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behave, you guys. No fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？- 嗨 杰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whatcha doin'? - Hi , Gerti.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 没干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just doing nothing... again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 墨西哥巧克力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - Mexican chocolate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:05:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你父母在哪儿？- 执行任务去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's your mom and dad? - On an assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的观点是 别参与家人的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was my idea not to be part of the family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都出任务了 你姐姐也是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all on missions. Your sister, too, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,自从去年圣诞节后我就没见过卡门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen Carmen since Christmas... Iast year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该重新加入欧斯 可能真用的着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should join back up. The OSS could really use you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 利用我 - 我不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. Use me. - Not what I meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别计较过去的事了朱尼 看看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hold on to the past, Juni. Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,9岁除了往上爬哪儿都去不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}9 years old and nowhere to go but up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,最值得依附的家 就是你出生的那个家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only tribe worth belonging to is the one that you're born into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的你的家庭 要好好照顾你的家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, your family. It's good to take care of your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但记住一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But remember one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都是你的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我德夫林就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you can call me Devlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,当你领导欧斯的时候 你不是就已经在治理这个国家了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weren't you already running the country when you were head of the OSS?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在治理着这个国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was running the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但是欧斯是个秘密组织 没人知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But since the OSS is a secret organization, no one knrw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要全世界都知道是由我掌权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted the world to know that I was in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我成了美国总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I became president of the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,全取决于你的喜好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all depends upon your preference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,事实或者认知认知对我较有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reality or perception. Perception works for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.57,0:06:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那我选事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm into reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是你一句话都不吭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the reality is, nothing you can say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就让我重新加入欧斯 那是你打电话来的目的对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will make me rejoin the OSS. That is why you called, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,欧斯需要你归队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The OSS needs you to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经退休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm retired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在谁还活在认知当中呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, who's living in perception now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是没有退休的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is there is no retirement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦为特工终身为特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once an agent, always an agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,该是你成熟点复职的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for you to be a big boy and reinstate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别无冒犯先生… 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect, sir, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那就坐稳了因为事实是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then hold on to your seat, because here's the reality:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你姐姐失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sister's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,带特工克兹到游戏理论部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking Agent Cortez to Games and Theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是超级特工克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's ex-Agent Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道那个人是个侦探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, that one's defective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,体型上有点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong with the shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我们能不能收回那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if we can take that one back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.24,0:07:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,唐纳根 最近的表现好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnagon. Been a good boy lately?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是的还行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very, very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,吉格斯夫人一定把你调教的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Giggles must have straightened you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.35,0:07:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 你好 弗朗西丝卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I certainly did. - Hello, Francesca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没错事实上她把我调教的非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, she worked me over pretty good, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 亲爱的规矩些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aah. - Darling, behave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对于那个叫"游戏结束"的电玩游戏 你了解多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about a video game called Game Over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道世界上的每个孩子 都会登入里头玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that just about every kid in the world is gonna sign on and play it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有我们协助就不会了这游戏是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if we can help it. The game is a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦游戏开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once plugged into the game,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,连父母亲都无法唤回孩子们的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}parents won't even be able to get their children's attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么新消息?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else is new?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有次不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦你开始玩游戏 你的心智便属于玩具制造商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you get through the game, your mind belongs to the Toymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个游戏的开发者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The inventor of the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.85,0:08:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他想透过心智控制 来奴役全世界的青少年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to enslave the world's youth with mind control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.35,0:08:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,控制了青少年也就控制了世界的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You control the youth, you control the future of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你姐姐是个聪明的黑客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's an ingenious hacker, your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们派她进去关闭这个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sent her inside to shut down the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…她消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... she disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么会在游戏中消失呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can she disappear inside a game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,消失的不是她的肉体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't physically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上她的身体还在这幢大楼里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, she's right here in the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门 卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen! Carmen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,她听不见的她的心智还在游戏里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can't hear you. Her mind's still in the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经到了第四关了 然后就失了踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She got as far as level four, then nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么让她单枪匹马到游戏里去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would she even go in there without any backup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她的最佳唯一人选 不肯回我们的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because her first and only choice wouldn't answer our calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,所以她决定一个人进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So she decided to go alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你进去去找你的姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you go in. Find your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在12小时之内帮助她关闭游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help her shut down the game in 12 hours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:09:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,否则大家都完蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or it's game over for everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你要加入我们吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.51,0:09:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那么就出发吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.25,0:09:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我必须关闭游戏 但不能放过玩具制造商?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I have to shut down the game but not release the Toymaker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没错如果让他跑了后果不堪设想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. It would be catastrophic if he escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,被关在虚拟世界中那么多年 他对我们恨之入骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T oymaker hates us for imprisoning him in cyberspace all these years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么要把他关起来？- 天知道？陈年往事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What made you do that? - Who knows? It was years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你得和大家一样从第一关打起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you'll have to start on level one like everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,到第四关找到你姐姐然后到达第五关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find your sister on level four. Then proceed to level five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那一关是攻不破的 - 第五关攻不破?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which is unwinnable. - Level five is unwinnable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,第五关也就是你关闭游戏程序的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Level five is where you shut down the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果游戏程序没能关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the game is not shut down,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.77,0:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会跟别人一样困在里头 等着玩具制造商统治世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll stay trapped with everyone else when the Toymaker takes over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把眼镜戴上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on these glasses,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会进入游戏世界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'll enter the world of the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你会被送到卡门旁边一间无重力室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're being sent into a zero-gravity chamber alongside Carmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那对你会比较有利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should give you a competitive edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,当你在游戏中东西会感觉很真实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're in the game, things will feel real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是真实的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,找到卡门 关闭游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Carmen. Shut down the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不论你做什么 千万别让玩具制造商出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whatever you do, don't let the Toymaker out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer-generated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,低资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Low-res!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门 卡门能听得见我说话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen. Carmen, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我是朱尼 你弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Juni, your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌的蟾蜍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pogo T oads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.41,0:11:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 去找你自己的座骑讨厌鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Get your own ride, creepo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我以为你是只蟾蜍呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry! I thought you were a toad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你是新手吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nrw player, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 新手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. New player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那好就给你上上课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here's a lesson you won't soon forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,脑电波正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His brain waves are normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但他情况怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,摔下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. He fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你摔落了三层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fell three stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我还活着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah. I survived?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不完全是那是你的生命值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly. That is your life count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:13:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,受重伤的话生命值会损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After taking heavy damage, you lose a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,到了零的时候会怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens when I hit zero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,当你生命值为零的时候你就输了 不能重玩不能重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you run out of life, you lose. No replays. No restarts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我的十二小时怎么回事？现在只剩四小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to my 12 hours? I only have four now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当你玩游戏的时候时间消耗很快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time flies when you're playing games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,动作最好快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我是朱尼·克兹 欧斯的超级特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Juni Cortez, ex-secret agent of the OSS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须到第五关去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get to level five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我只剩几小时可以去阻止 玩具制造商控制世界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I only have a frw hours before the T oymaker takes over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 第五关？- 第五关是攻不破的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Level five? - Level five is unwinnable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白那点但是我得去拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand that. But I have to save the world.{\r}
