Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,当然除非是逼不得已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless, of course, you can 't help yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.37,0:21:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I' m Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.74,0:21:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哦很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh , l' m sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉不是故意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. He didn't mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真的真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.85,0:21:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.97,0:22:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我叫德米雀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'm Demetra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.56,0:23:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那一定很痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! That's gotta hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.09,0:24:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我是胜利者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the winner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.63,0:25:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.67,0:25:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对一个不懂如何格斗的孩子来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a kid that doesn't know how to fight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.74,0:25:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定懂得如何格斗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you sure know how to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.04,0:25:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你衣服穿着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations. And keep the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.18,0:25:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.82,0:25:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那么让我们再重来一遍如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, let's go over this again, shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.45,0:25:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有失误 没有严重失误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there's no mistake. So there's no gross error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们之间没有沟通不良问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there's no lack of communication amongst us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.76,0:25:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要我们想要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I want, what we want...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.76,0:25:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想要什么来着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.77,0:25:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这星球上的时代已经结束了 该是属于年轻人的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our time on this planet is over. It belongs now to our youth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.14,0:25:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我们控制住他们的思想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if we control their minds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.81,0:25:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那样我们就可以重新开创这个世界 治愈它所有的疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could start the world over again and cure it of its diseases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.44,0:25:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以重新来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could begin anrw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.89,0:25:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,忘掉那些可以做的吧 这是我们应该做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget what we could do! It's what we should do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在做的正确吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I doing the right thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.73,0:26:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是正不正确的问题而是聪不聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not about the right thing. It's about the smart thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.33,0:26:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我们逃不出这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't escape this place otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.20,0:26:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当我说"我们要出去"的时候 是代表我们所有人说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I speak for all of us when I say, "We want out!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.61,0:26:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,结局会证明这个方法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end justifies the means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.81,0:26:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你掌握着孩子们的注意力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the children's attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.14,0:26:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是你在教他们什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is, what are you teaching them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.32,0:26:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.22,0:26:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.05,0:26:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅请原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me. Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.02,0:26:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我偶尔会忘记我的程式分身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forget the extent of my programming powers from time to time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.43,0:26:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有一阵子我真的相信你们存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a moment, I actually believed that you existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.34,0:26:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,出去出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out, out, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.74,0:26:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,出去出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.68,0:26:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这个幼稚的游戏很快会结束的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This childish game will soon be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.05,0:26:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真实的游戏即将开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then the real game will begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.94,0:27:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you look at this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.78,0:27:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,拿好你的操纵杆各位 我想我们找到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on to your joysticks, boys. I think we got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.75,0:27:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.12,0:27:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.29,0:27:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"家伙" 海报里的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Guy. The guy from the poster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.49,0:27:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.83,0:27:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.09,0:27:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在找我的姐姐 她在第四关的某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm only looking for my sister. She's somrwhere on level four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.10,0:27:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我要通过第五关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'm heading out through level five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.40,0:27:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你能赢得比赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can win the game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.40,0:27:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想那是一个可以关闭它的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that's one way of putting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.44,0:28:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧根据技术手册上说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, according to the tech manual,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.08,0:28:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们找到那个"家伙"…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we find the Guy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.91,0:28:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这"家伙"…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Guy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.65,0:28:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他会带领我们通过那个攻不破的关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll lead us through the unwinnable level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.98,0:28:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只因为他一下子就过了机械关卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just 'cause he made it out of Robocon in one piece{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.45,0:28:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,并不意味着他就是这"家伙"啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean he's the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.89,0:28:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我见过第一位穿着能量装通过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the first I've seen to make it out with the power suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.02,0:28:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧这胆小鬼是个冒牌货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, give me a break. This wimp's a phony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.83,0:28:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个办法可以证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one way to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.20,0:28:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大型赛车比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mega Race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.50,0:28:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏世界中最高速 最危险的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fastest, most dangerous race in the game world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.21,0:28:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 不等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - No. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.51,0:28:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我都告诉你我不是这"家伙"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already told you I'm not the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.71,0:28:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛马上就要开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The race will begin shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.98,0:28:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,选定自己的车辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claim your vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.19,0:28:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是在开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to be kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.06,0:28:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这个比赛可以辨识出 你究竟是不是"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This race will tell us if you're the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.10,0:28:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是的话就可以和我们一块作伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you are, you can hang with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.27,0:28:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你不是阿诺德会把你撕碎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you're a phony, Arnold will crush you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.11,0:29:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是这"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.87,0:29:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,到底要我说多少遍呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times do I have to say it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.41,0:29:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛没有任何规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no rules in this race,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.81,0:29:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不惜代价取胜便行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except win at any cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.75,0:29:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.65,0:29:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会尽全力去帮你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll try to help you out... as much as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.15,0:29:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛即将开始…开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The race will begin... now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.02,0:29:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 三出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.55,0:30:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 非常简单 - 朱尼按红色按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Easy as pie. - Juni , push the red button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.25,0:30:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那个写着"不准按"的按钮?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one that says "Do not push"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.12,0:30:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没错按下它它是个加速按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Push it. It's a turbo boost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你肯定？- 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.57,0:30:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 雷兹 伸个援手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rez, give me a hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.64,0:30:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 伸只脚如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how about a foot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.36,0:31:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,换我开了 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My turn, sucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.93,0:31:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该会赢得比赛的 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be winning the race, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.84,0:31:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.93,0:31:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The glove!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.87,0:32:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab the glove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.84,0:32:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The glove!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,抓另一辆车朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab another bike, Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.44,0:34:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final stretch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,五… 四…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five... four...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.20,0:34:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,三… 二… 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three... two... one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.17,0:34:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,坐钢圈的胜利者朱尼·克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winner by a hubcap, Juni Cortez!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.76,0:34:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得你就是他 - 我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought you were him. - I knrw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.10,0:35:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.31,0:35:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你就是"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I hear you're the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.91,0:35:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am definitely the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.10,0:35:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在想干嘛"家伙"？- 我得和我爷爷说两句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So now what, Guy? - I have to go talk to my grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.51,0:35:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,和谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.31,0:35:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说我得和…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean I must confer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.01,0:35:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,和阿塔利世嘉任天堂的精灵说两句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Wizard of Atari-Sega-Nendo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.35,0:35:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好的 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. OK, cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.26,0:36:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你赢得了比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations. You won the race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.13,0:36:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在他们认为我是某个重要人物 可以替他们赢得比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now they think I'm some important guy who's going to win for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.80,0:36:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这对我们来说很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For our purposes, that's very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.37,0:36:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以带领我们更快到达第四关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can lead us to level four more quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.97,0:36:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就可以去找你姐姐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can find your sister,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.51,0:36:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就可关闭游戏让一切恢复正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can shut down the game and make things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.44,0:36:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就可以找到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so that I can find...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.15,0:36:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具制造商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Toymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.35,0:36:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不可接近玩具制造商的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not supposed to get near the Toymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.85,0:36:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,欧斯的规则上有说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So say the rules of the OSS,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.76,0:36:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不遵守呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which I'm not following.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.99,0:36:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他很可能会跑掉我们不能冒那个险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He might escape. We can't risk that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.23,0:36:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.93,0:36:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我没打算让他跑掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't plan on letting him go anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.60,0:36:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.91,0:36:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事我们以后再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll talk about this later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.84,0:36:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Here it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.68,0:36:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不该是我带你们到第五关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not supposed to lead you to level five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.78,0:36:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是你们带我去的呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to lead me there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.92,0:37:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那你意思是说我们同心协力?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you mean we work together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.99,0:37:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵说只要我们同心协力就会胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wizard said if we all work together, we all win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.49,0:37:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,靠我的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With my strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.96,0:37:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.63,0:37:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我的酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.76,0:37:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我的直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My intuition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.90,0:37:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好 所以说你是"家伙" 我们全指望你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. So you're the Guy. We're all counting on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.20,0:37:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果你害我们失败 或者你不是你所说那个人的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you fail us or if you're not who you say you are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.74,0:37:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这生命值计数器会比你 喊声"噢"还要快归零\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this life counter will hit zero faster than you can say "oops."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.01,0:37:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一言为定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.38,0:37:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,首先我得去找我姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First I got to find my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.88,0:37:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,去第四关吧各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So level four, people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.52,0:37:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.53,0:37:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快点爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Grandpa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.63,0:37:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他干得不赖对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's doing good, huh? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.56,0:37:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没错他干得不错但这就是问题所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's doing great, and that's the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.53,0:37:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.54,0:37:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们唤醒了程式设计师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've awoken the Programmerz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.97,0:37:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.41,0:37:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶紧把他拉出来 - 太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull him out of there now. - Too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.21,0:38:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好的这太酷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. This is cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.88,0:38:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们马上就会到那儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get there in no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.79,0:38:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.86,0:38:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.76,0:38:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,程式设计师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Programmerz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.03,0:38:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是程式设计师?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are these Programmerz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.73,0:38:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就是编写这个游戏程式的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brainiacs who wrote the book for the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.94,0:38:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说他们是为玩具制造商工作的了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, they work for the Toymaker, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.61,0:38:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为他们 你们才会在第一关找到我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Programmerz are the reason you found us on level one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.14,0:38:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们逮到弗朗西斯在 大型赛车比赛时候作弊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They caught Francis cheating during the Mega Race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.65,0:38:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们抓到我们的话 我们就得从第一关重新打起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll bounce us back to level one again if they catch us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.45,0:38:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,第一关？我可没有时间重打了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Level one? I don't have time for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.15,0:38:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,散开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spread out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.42,0:38:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别散开 行不通的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't split up! It never works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.62,0:38:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们团结在一起…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we just stick together...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.83,0:38:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧爷爷我想就剩你和我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Grandpa. I guess it's just you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:38:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.23,0:39:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.15,0:39:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你该尝试表现的像"家伙"吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you at least try and act like you're the Guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.35,0:39:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我的秘密?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know my secret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.42,0:39:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过真的"家伙"你不是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen the real Guy, and you're not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.59,0:39:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么程式设计师要追我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are Programmerz chasing us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.49,0:39:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在游戏中作弊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's got a game cheat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.26,0:39:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.43,0:39:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A map to the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.03,0:39:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是违反规则的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.70,0:39:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你想不想找到你姐姐?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to find your sister or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.37,0:39:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,把地图给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.97,0:39:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.61,0:39:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在位置在机器城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in Machine City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.08,0:39:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,直接穿过这儿的话就能够到达第四关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we cut across here, we'll be able to reach level four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.08,0:39:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where Carmen is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.68,0:39:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.78,0:39:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,然后如果抄近路穿过熔岩山的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, if we cut through Lava Mountain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.75,0:39:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能到达不败关卡的关口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll be right at the door of the unwinnable level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.29,0:39:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,抄近路很好这太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shortcuts. This is good. This is very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.29,0:39:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛作弊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game cheats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.79,0:40:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这不符合规定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's against the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.43,0:40:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不得不让你们回到第一关去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have to bounce you back to level one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.84,0:40:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 你吓不了我们 他可"家伙"呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aah! - You can't scare us. He's the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.77,0:40:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.54,0:40:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,听见了吧 埃道格 "家伙"在呼叫他的爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to that, Edog. The Guy is calling his grandpa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.55,0:40:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我好害怕 来抓我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so scared. Come and get me, Gramps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.65,0:40:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他能怎么样 逗我们开心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he gonna do, drool on us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.42,0:40:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么要找我孙子麻烦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you picking on my grandson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.29,0:40:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.59,0:40:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们抓到了罗格斯和埃道格领导者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got Logos and Edog, the leaders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.06,0:40:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是程序设计师?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are Programmerz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.40,0:40:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来看看你们真正的长相吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what you really look like, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.71,0:40:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真是令人印象深刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very unimpressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.11,0:40:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer nerds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.08,0:40:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我玩具制造商在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now tell me, where is the Toymaker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.65,0:40:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷…精灵放他们下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa... uh, Wizard, put them down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.53,0:41:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他很厉害呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.27,0:41:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这男孩战士非常非常厉害呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy warrior is very, very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.37,0:41:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但他得继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's got to keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.01,0:41:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果接下来的几关难度太大的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We run the risk of discouraging him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.94,0:41:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,会冒令他心灰意冷的险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the next levels are too challenging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.81,0:41:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但只有不断挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But only by seeking challenges{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.71,0:41:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,才有希望找出其中的佼佼者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can we hope to find the best in ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.02,0:41:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以帮他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we help him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.22,0:41:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这样违反游戏规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! It's against the rules of the game!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.49,0:41:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.39,0:41:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.49,0:41:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不介意我自言自语吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mind talking to myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.53,0:41:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但当你们把我排除在谈话之外时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when you guys start to cut me out of the conversation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.73,0:41:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就变得有点古怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's when it gets a little strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.47,0:41:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没错我们需要更棒的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. More life is what we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.51,0:41:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会送这小子一份礼物 生命值的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll grant the boy a gift. The gift of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.25,0:42:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.58,0:42:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,从这儿起我会保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From here on out, I'll protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.09,0:42:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧"家伙"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right, Guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.69,0:42:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿他找到加血包了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. He found a life pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.86,0:42:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.03,0:42:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这很罕见啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's rare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.36,0:42:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前从没看过加血包有这么近的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen one up close before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.73,0:42:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.23,0:42:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,用手将它捏碎就会获得生命值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crush it in your hands. You'll gain life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.50,0:42:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,加多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.90,0:42:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All depends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.41,0:42:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我得到补充生命值了 德米雀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got extra life, Demetra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.58,0:42:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 你最需要它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations. You'll need it the most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.68,0:42:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你收下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.59,0:42:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼 我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.36,0:42:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他知不知道那东西值多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he knowwhat that's worth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.00,0:42:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.73,0:42:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在机器人竞技场时我欠你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owed you from the Robot Arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.37,0:43:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我不希望你发生什么不测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, I don't want anything to happen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.21,0:43:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.18,0:43:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你们已进入第三关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have now entered level three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.56,0:43:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我的家人能见见这奇妙的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish my family could see this amazing place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.23,0:43:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,阿诺德 你在游戏中是干什么的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing in the game, Arnold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.18,0:43:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 我是靠测试员通行证进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, actually, I got in on a beta tester's visa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.98,0:43:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来拿过第五关后的大奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here for the great prize behind level five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.98,0:43:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它可以让我全家摆脱贫困\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll save my family from poverty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.12,0:43:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在第五关有什么东西呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what waits for us in level five?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.15,0:43:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说全是真的吗？数不清的财宝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, is it all true? Untold riches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.72,0:43:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,阿诺德你要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arnold, you should know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.19,0:43:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们到了关底的时候…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that when we reach the end of the game...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别别再说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Don't tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.00,0:44:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,希望会是个惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want it to be a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.50,0:44:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure it will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.04,0:44:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,玩家们注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, gamers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.47,0:44:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,站到红线上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand on the red line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.11,0:44:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,选出你们中间最优秀的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choose your best player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.88,0:44:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"家伙"! "家伙"是最优秀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Guy! The Guy's the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.45,0:44:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,选出你们当中最强壮的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choose your strongest player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.79,0:44:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是阿诺德了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be Arnold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.77,0:44:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,适者生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Survival of the fittest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.47,0:44:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,面向你们的对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face your opponent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.18,0:44:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我 不要和阿诺德打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. I'm not fighting Arnold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.18,0:44:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不想打倒朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to crush Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.05,0:44:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利者将和其他人一起进入第四关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The winner shall proceed with the others to level four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.15,0:44:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,失败者将会立即终止游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The loser shall be given an immediate game over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.65,0:44:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,并且会被永远逐出游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and will be evacuated permanently from the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.12,0:45:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,阿诺德 我得去救我姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arnold , I have to save my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.86,0:45:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I' m sorry, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.03,0:45:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但我得替我的家人着想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have my own family to think about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.77,0:45:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我打不赢你的 阿诺德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't beat you , Arnold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.17,0:45:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.07,0:45:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.69,0:46:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我特别支持谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that I'm rooting for anyone in particular,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.99,0:46:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但那一招确实很酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that was a really cool move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.21,0:46:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice knowing you , Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.01,0:46:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,阿诺德 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arnold, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.85,0:46:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.49,0:46:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以过关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been tagged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.32,0:46:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思 我过关了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean , I've been tagged?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.26,0:46:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有人和你换了位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone has switched places with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.03,0:46:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not me, Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.47,0:46:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,德米雀 你在作什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demetra, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.20,0:46:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你还得去找你姐姐呢 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to find your sister, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.31,0:46:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't! Don't do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.68,0:47:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,德米雀 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demetra, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.08,0:47:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.22,0:47:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.66,0:47:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,德米雀 游戏结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demetra, game over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.87,0:47:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至连她的伊眉儿都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never even got her e-mail address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.01,0:47:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别爱上游戏中的人朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't fall in love with a game, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.28,0:47:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开这儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.95,0:47:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.06,0:47:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.93,0:47:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你引起了这么多的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are causing so much pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.87,0:47:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我才可以阻止你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And only I can stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.04,0:48:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道为什么你要做这些事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For I knowwhy you do these things...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具制造商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.55,0:48:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,放马过来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,来找我啊 世界会真正付出代价的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find me, and the world will truly pay the price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.22,0:48:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不建造出我的数位监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here in my cyberprison I was forced to create.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.33,0:48:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我将会毁灭世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I will destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.57,0:48:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,放了那女孩让她回游戏中去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the girl. Put her back in the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.07,0:48:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但是先生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.14,0:48:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你有更好的解决办法 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you have a better solution, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.34,0:48:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你当然有了你们全都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you do. You all do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.01,0:48:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那么告诉我真正答案是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me. What is the real answer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.08,0:48:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很好奇 - 复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm so curious. - Revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.58,0:48:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 治愈 - 毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Healing. - Destruction!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.58,0:48:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爱 - 恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Love. - Hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.29,0:48:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们全部又对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, once again, you're all correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.86,0:48:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但也全部又错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once again, you're all incorrect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.13,0:49:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On with the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.41,0:49:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们现在正要进入第四关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are now entering level four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.78,0:49:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,第四关？等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Level four? Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.68,0:49:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门就在这一关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen's on this level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.29,0:49:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我用心灵感应找找看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll use telepathy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.63,0:49:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可能够近了应该感应的到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might be close enough that it'll work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.03,0:49:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门 能听见我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.00,0:49:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.93,0:49:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这游戏会耍诈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This game plays tricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.97,0:49:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我只有卡门会说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something only Carmen would say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.84,0:49:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我有脚臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My feet stink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.27,0:49:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你听起来很近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.81,0:49:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你带爷爷进了游戏里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you brought Grandpa into the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.63,0:50:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这时候那么做是个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was a good idea at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.96,0:50:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.93,0:50:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具制造商就是三十年前 害得爷爷坐轮椅的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Toymaker's the guy who put Grandpa in the wheelchair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.40,0:50:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.14,0:50:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果爷爷想要报仇 玩具制造商就会被放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Grandpa tries to take revenge, the Toymaker will break free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.01,0:50:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他很强大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's that powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.81,0:50:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们必须说服爷爷 复仇并不是解决问题的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we have to convince Grandpa that revenge is not the way to solve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.62,0:50:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好了"家伙"我们找到你的同伴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, Guy. We found your pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.69,0:50:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在到底要去哪儿？第五关在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where are we going, exactly? Where's level five?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.59,0:50:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,首先别在这儿问问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First of all, you don't ask the questions around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.09,0:50:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道在哪第二…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do. Second of all...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.16,0:50:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要去熔岩山 - 我们要去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're going to Lava Mountain. - We are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.20,0:50:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,越过那座山就是第五关的通道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond that is the passage to level five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.77,0:50:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.93,0:50:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你突然变成游戏专家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, so suddenly you're the game expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.30,0:50:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟"家伙"走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're following the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.97,0:50:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼 要知道我们不需要这些人跟着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Juni, we don't need these guys following us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.08,0:50:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去的地方不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not where we're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.41,0:50:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应他们会一起过关的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised them they could tag along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.58,0:50:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧我就是这样 知道我们该去哪儿的 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, this is how I knowwhere to go. Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.42,0:51:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,熔岩山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lava Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.42,0:51:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么每个电玩游戏中都有熔岩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it that every video game has lava in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.73,0:51:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,技术上来说这说法不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically, that's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.49,0:51:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在《光环》游戏中就没有熔岩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no lava in Halo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.56,0:51:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在《陨石》游戏中是熔浆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in Metroid, it's molten magma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.73,0:51:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰熔岩否则就游戏结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't touch the lava, or it's game over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.47,0:51:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我还剩六格血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have six lives left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.04,0:51:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那不重要一掉下去就输掉游戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter. You fall in, you lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.71,0:51:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,各位游戏越来越难了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game's getting tougher, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.28,0:51:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.78,0:51:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样爷爷?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.81,0:51:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.28,0:51:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,走别条路吧跟我走各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go another way. Follow me, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.12,0:51:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没道理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了他们地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give them a map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.82,0:51:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了他们那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give them the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.89,0:51:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还想要怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What more do they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.09,0:51:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,难道要我把他们带到关口那儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't I just lead them to the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.16,0:51:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能的先生 游戏人工智慧运作方式是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible, sir. The way the game's A.I. works is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.90,0:51:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.17,0:51:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我自言自语不行吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I just talk to myself at least?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.07,0:51:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你在自言自语而我就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are talking to yourself. I am you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.91,0:51:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你 我…都闭嘴吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, you, me, shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.81,0:51:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.31,0:52:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我疯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I insane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.61,0:52:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,完全疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Completely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.99,0:52:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们走错路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going the wrong way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.96,0:52:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我得让他们到第五关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to drive them to level five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.93,0:52:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,派锅怪进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send in the Tinker Toys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.57,0:52:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,找另一条路这是个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finding another path. Now, this is good thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.40,0:52:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她很厉害我们应该多听听她的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's good. We should listen to her more often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.81,0:52:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别站我旁边 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay off my side. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.48,0:52:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.13,0:52:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,锅怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tinker Toys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.67,0:52:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 熔岩和锅怪哪个比较糟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! What's worse, lava or Tinker T oys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.64,0:53:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是锅怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely Tinker T oys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.41,0:53:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门 我们该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen, what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.62,0:53:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,冲浪啰 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rip that wave, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.03,0:53:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.03,0:54:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们偏离道路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're straying from the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.20,0:54:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具制造商一定是想把他们 引入他的老巢里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T oymaker must be pushing them towards his lair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.84,0:54:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但为什么呢？他能获得什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why? What could he gain from...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.57,0:54:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,查查看爷爷和玩具制造商之间 是否有所关连性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check if there's a connection between the grandfather and the Toymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.91,0:54:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快点各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.24,0:54:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,屏幕上显示出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming on-screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.81,0:54:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,化友为敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comrades turned enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.15,0:54:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷想把玩具制造商从游戏里放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa's gonna break the Toymaker out of the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.45,0:54:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.99,0:54:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,搅动熔岩波浪大一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stir the lava. Bigger waves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.73,0:54:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,熔岩怪兽随便什么都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lava monsters. Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.43,0:54:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得给他们创造些障碍物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to create obstacles for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.30,0:54:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.43,0:54:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须淹死他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to drown them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.20,0:54:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那他们游戏就会结束 会被逐出游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll get a game over and be evacuated from the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.67,0:54:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能冒玩具制造商被放出来的险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't risk letting the Toymaker out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.81,0:54:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.92,0:54:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这是新增的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is nrw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.92,0:54:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.53,0:55:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.97,0:55:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Francis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.87,0:55:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,阿诺德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arnold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.17,0:55:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.11,0:55:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.35,0:55:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们到哪儿去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.72,0:55:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,掉进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They fell in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.92,0:55:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道但应该显示游戏结束的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but they should have gotten a game over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.89,0:55:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上他们应该回到这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They should be back here, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.57,0:55:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,熔岩是冷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lava. It's cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.61,0:55:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这边朱尼这边 我们找到下一关的入口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Juni. This way. We found a door to the next level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.18,0:55:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.85,0:55:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为我完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I was a goner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.45,0:56:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到我的点数 在我眼前闪来闪去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw all my points flashing away before my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.52,0:56:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我只听到我爸在说 "阿诺德你搞砸了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I could hear was my father saying , "You blrw it, Arnold."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.69,0:56:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"你没有数不清的财宝了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"No untold riches for you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.77,0:56:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.17,0:56:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道可是他刚刚还在这儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. But he was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.27,0:56:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不是他盔甲上的东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this a piece of his armor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.58,0:56:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门 是通道帮忙打开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen, it's a passage. Help me open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.95,0:56:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,红旗 雷兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red flag, Rez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.35,0:56:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈这位"家伙"高度敏感问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to talk about the Guy. Highly sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.98,0:56:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.59,0:56:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直复习我的技术手册\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been rereading my tech manual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.96,0:56:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,里面说到游戏中有一个骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It speaks of a deceiver within the game,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.59,0:56:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,会误导我们到一个万劫不复之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who will mislead you down a path where no one will survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.63,0:56:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得朱尼就是这个骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Juni's the deceiver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.90,0:56:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你有何建议?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you suggest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.23,0:56:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得除掉他 不然就有输掉游戏的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to get rid of him or risk losing the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.67,0:56:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那他姐姐怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about his sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.81,0:56:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.95,0:57:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还剩多少时间？- 五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much time do we have left? - Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.62,0:57:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,五分钟里会发生什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens in five minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.25,0:57:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方会挤满了世界各地来的玩家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place gets flooded with players from around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.99,0:57:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了有的竞争了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great. Competition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.26,0:57:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具制造商会控制他们的心智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Toymaker will take over their minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.26,0:57:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们得关闭游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we have to shut down the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.99,0:57:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘘卡门 - 她在说什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sh, Carmen! - What is she talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没告诉他们吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't tell them yet, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.27,0:57:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我正想说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was getting around to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.83,0:57:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deceivers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.97,0:57:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,第五关另一边是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the other side of level five?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.17,0:57:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么另一边 你们会被囚禁在这游戏里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no other side. You'll be imprisoned in the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.54,0:57:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.71,0:57:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会让你们关闭游戏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not letting you shut down this game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.91,0:57:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们会明白计数器倒数会有多快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna see how fast that counter can count backwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.18,0:57:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那你得先过我这关游戏小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to go through me first, game boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.69,0:57:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不听我说我是"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, listen to me. I'm the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.52,0:57:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别再说你是"家伙"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop saying you're the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.36,0:57:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道你不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all know that you're not the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.69,0:57:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.43,0:57:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.17,0:58:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.27,0:58:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我是"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.78,0:58:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.54,0:58:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我说我们进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I say we go in,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.74,0:58:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,战胜这号称不败关卡到达另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beat this unwinnable level, and get to the other side,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.58,0:58:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那儿有数不尽的财宝 和十个城池大的土地等着我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where untold riches and a bounty fit for 10 kings awaits us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.42,0:58:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knrw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.65,0:58:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好了他绝对是"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, he's definitely the Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.66,0:58:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但它是攻不破的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's unwinnable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.50,0:58:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么是攻不破的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing is unwinnable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.57,0:58:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们齐心协力 同仇敌忾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we join together and battle as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.10,0:58:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,发挥各人的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We play on each other's strengths{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.20,0:58:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,弥补彼此的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and help cover each other's weaknesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.41,0:58:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就能达成任何事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can accomplish anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.87,0:58:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会达成所有事情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we will accomplish everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.68,0:58:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但首先我们要去战胜这道攻不破的关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first let's go whip this unwinnable level{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.68,0:58:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让它看看谁才是老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and show it who's boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.22,0:58:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要加入吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.28,0:58:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.75,0:58:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,站到旁边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.04,0:59:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,小意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.05,0:59:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.56,0:59:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.16,0:59:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你又是"家伙"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. You're the Guy again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.43,0:59:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,带我们通过这儿吧朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us through this, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.17,0:59:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But l...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.78,0:59:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,德米雀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demetra!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.15,0:59:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.38,0:59:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到关闭游戏的开关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found the switch to shut down the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.35,0:59:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我还找到了出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also found the exit portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.95,0:59:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们马上都能从这儿出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can all get out of here right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.92,0:59:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么还活着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you survive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.16,0:59:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏出了点小故障 我也不太清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a glitch in the game. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.76,1:00:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼她是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni, who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.39,1:00:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她是德米雀 我女朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Demetra, my girlf...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.13,1:00:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友 不她是我的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend. No, she's my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.56,1:00:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他女朋友你又是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm his girlfriend. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.50,1:00:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm his sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.57,1:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她给了我到这儿的地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She gave me the map. The map that got us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.77,1:00:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼她不是真人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni, she's not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.61,1:00:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.28,1:00:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直帮忙 朱尼获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been helping Juni win the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.28,1:00:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你又做了些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you been doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.68,1:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就只会扮演囚犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Playing prisoner. That's what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.42,1:00:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她陷害了你朱尼她陷害我们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She set you up, Juni. She set us all up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.85,1:00:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我…朱尼她撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... Juni, she's lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.32,1:00:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她是玩具制造商的囚犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's been the Toymaker's prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.99,1:00:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,据我们所知她可能被洗了脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She could be brainwashed, for all we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.86,1:00:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想不想赢得比赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to win this game or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.60,1:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这一关之所以攻不破 就是因为她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the reason this level's unwinnable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.37,1:00:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the deceiver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.34,1:00:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.54,1:00:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.04,1:00:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的程式就是这么设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's in my programming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.82,1:01:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.45,1:01:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们已到达游戏的关底 你们赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've made it to the end of the game! You won!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.56,1:01:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,无尽的财宝都是你们的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Untold riches for all of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.36,1:01:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而你们的奖品就是…待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your prize is you get to stay... here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.80,1:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到游戏中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.98,1:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni , this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.81,1:01:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.08,1:01:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you , quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.08,1:01:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我们得去关闭游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! We have to shut down the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.25,1:01:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经关了开关就在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already did. The switch is right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.46,1:01:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定？- 当然当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure? - Yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.76,1:01:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快点走吧快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Quickly, quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.67,1:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, Grandpa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.44,1:01:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧我来顶着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. I'll hold it open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.74,1:01:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快点走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.81,1:01:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,德米雀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demetra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.38,1:02:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法永远按住的朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hold it open forever, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.75,1:02:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.09,1:02:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的伊眉儿地址以防万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's our e-mail addresses. Just in case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.22,1:02:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,妙极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.93,1:02:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷你真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're awesome, Grandpa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.66,1:02:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你对付那些锅怪的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way you took on those Tinker Toys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.77,1:02:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你是最酷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the coolest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.84,1:02:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,万分感谢"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for everything, Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.47,1:02:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was real. Sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.51,1:02:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,谢啦"家伙"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot, Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.46,1:02:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.79,1:02:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想离开吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to leave, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.16,1:02:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎能回去呢朱尼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I go back, Juni?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.60,1:02:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿我能走能跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here, I can walk. I can run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.60,1:03:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你把我当作一个超级大英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you look at me like I'm some kind of superhero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.91,1:03:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你本来就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.44,1:03:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说在外面的真实世界里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out there in the real world, to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.75,1:03:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.11,1:03:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.08,1:03:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会回去的只要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall go back if...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.59,1:03:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你答应我即使我坐在轮椅上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you promise me that even though I'll be in a wheelchair,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.52,1:03:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你还一样能像现在这样看待我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you will look at me no differently than you are now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.86,1:03:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,因为在我内心朱尼在内心里 我想要这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because on the inside, Juni, on the inside, I feel like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.50,1:03:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise, Grandpa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.11,1:03:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.52,1:03:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,借过麻烦借过一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming through. Coming through, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.26,1:03:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那些电玩游戏就是视觉杀手吧孩子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those video games are killers on the eyes, huh, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.16,1:03:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,特工克兹 我们要拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Cortez, we'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.20,1:03:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孙子会处理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandson will handle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰这可是柯林斯皮呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch. This is Corinthian leather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.77,1:04:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.71,1:04:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍 你们是怎么关闭游戏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me again how you shut off the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.38,1:04:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上我不太清楚是否关闭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if we shut it down, exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.48,1:04:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们扳动了开关 好像起作用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hit a switch, and it seemed to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.32,1:04:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是起作用了 游戏被关闭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it worked. The game's down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.38,1:04:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是得弄清楚 做的对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just need to make sure we did this correctly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.39,1:04:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上是爷爷扳动的开关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, Grandpa hit the switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.42,1:04:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,克兹这些是在游戏中 和你一块的孩子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cortez, are these the boys that were in the game with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.43,1:04:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们透过伊眉儿找到了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tracked them through their e-mail addresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.66,1:04:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们没错 他们不懂得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's them. They wouldn't know anything about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.23,1:04:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.63,1:04:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明的弗朗西斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to Francis the Brain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.07,1:04:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,强壮的阿诺德和超酷先生呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arnold the Strong, and Mr. Cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.17,1:04:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现实世界中我没那么聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in the real world, I'm not that smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.48,1:04:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.54,1:04:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.28,1:04:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真相是残酷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reality check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.68,1:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那么现实世界中你是谁呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who are you out here in the real world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.08,1:04:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,超级特工克兹我们需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special Agent Cortez, we need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.06,1:04:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是朱尼·克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just Juni Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.89,1:05:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧爷爷你到底扳了哪个开关?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have it, Grandpa. What switch did you hit exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.13,1:05:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那儿有两个开关并排的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were two switches side by side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.23,1:05:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一个用来关闭游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One switch shuts down the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.10,1:05:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但另一个是释放玩具制造商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the other releases the Toymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.17,1:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个白痴设计的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was the idiot who designed that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.01,1:05:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是不小心释放了玩具制造商?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you free the T oymaker by accident?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.61,1:05:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我是释放了玩具制造商但不是不小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I freed the T oymaker. But it was no accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.75,1:05:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你想不想阻止这个游戏?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to stop the game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.15,1:05:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你就必须打败玩具制造商 这是唯一的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you must defeat the T oymaker. It's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.52,1:05:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个疯老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You crazy old man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.92,1:05:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你做了什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what you've done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.89,1:05:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷复仇不能解决问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa, revenge doesn't solve anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.96,1:05:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信我吗？你们所有人都相信我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you trust me? You of all people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.36,1:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,总统先生传来的讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A message from the president.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.80,1:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他想干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what does he want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.13,1:05:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回来和他们算帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming back to settle the score.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.67,1:05:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们监禁了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For imprisoning me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.97,1:05:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,利用了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For using me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.78,1:05:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,德夫林陷害我们的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devlin set us up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.38,1:05:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不是德夫林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not Devlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.55,1:05:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想要纠正错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I wanted to do was right the wrongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.65,1:05:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,开始一个新的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start over a new world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.42,1:05:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一个新的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new chance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.62,1:06:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都能得到第二次机会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where every.one would get a second chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.49,1:06:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.63,1:06:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在我要把游戏带到下一关去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now I'm taking this to the next level!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.74,1:06:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,地图显示有地震活动发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seismic activity off the map!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.37,1:06:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,地震\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earthquake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.47,1:06:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,龙卷风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T ornado!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.94,1:06:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,飓风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurricane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.51,1:06:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen , let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.55,1:06:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,诸位别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, relax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.43,1:06:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 赶紧把眼镜戴上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! Put your glasses on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.20,1:06:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这样你才能看清真正发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way you can see what's really happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.37,1:06:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏已经进入到真实世界中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game has entered the real world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.44,1:06:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这种情况下只能做一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one thing to do in a situation like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.41,1:06:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.85,1:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,给家里打电话召集全家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call in the family. Calling all Cortezes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.42,1:07:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没错没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it. This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.39,1:07:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.96,1:07:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们期待已久的一刻到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moment we've been waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.59,1:07:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.13,1:07:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不准动谁都不准动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move. Nobody move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.77,1:07:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不许碰那个脑第五脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody touch the brain. The fifth brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.54,1:07:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是历史性的一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a historic moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.64,1:07:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.48,1:07:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可能最重要的是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably the most important...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.78,1:07:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.92,1:07:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我一生中最重要的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the most important moment of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.89,1:07:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没人会打扰我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can disturb me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.19,1:07:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须启动大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must activate the brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.20,1:07:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.26,1:07:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,克兹先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Cortez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.60,1:07:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你的孩子来电情况有点紧急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your children called. Some sort of emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.61,1:08:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他们的叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm their uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.66,1:08:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸你得戴上这个来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you need these to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.96,1:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,眼镜快戴上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glasses, quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.24,1:08:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.99,1:08:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这不太容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This won't be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.07,1:08:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,来踢点金属吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's kick some metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.24,1:09:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about all the other ones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.45,1:09:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要更多援助我们家族不够庞大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more help. Our family isn't big enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.05,1:09:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,记住一件事大家都是你的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember one thing. Everyone's your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.06,1:09:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫…所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calling... everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.50,1:09:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来拯救今天吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here to save the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.20,1:09:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,小喽啰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floop and Minion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.34,1:09:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robot children!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.18,1:09:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把它们拆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take 'em down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.25,1:09:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,牛仔帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dinky Winks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.25,1:09:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有人打电话给牛仔我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody ring the Dinkster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.40,1:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你会教我的主题公园增色不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna make a nice addition to my theme park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.87,1:10:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计你完了 完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game over for you, pal. Game over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.48,1:10:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有人打电话要单挑吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody call in a loon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.25,1:10:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 罗梅罗 只剩下这付眼镜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Romero, this is the only pair we had left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.88,1:10:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有点破损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a little broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.09,1:10:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.02,1:10:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,进攻 史波奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge, Sporky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.26,1:10:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸宰了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brand him, Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.26,1:10:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢小牛仔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Little Dink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.65,1:10:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,加利·吉格斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gary Giggles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.85,1:10:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 卡门·克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Carmen Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.52,1:10:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你立刻来帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.98,1:10:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.76,1:11:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.99,1:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.30,1:11:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃! - 多谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unh! - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.44,1:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.64,1:11:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你杰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Gerti.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.84,1:11:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's still one more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.73,1:11:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.63,1:11:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,得有个人爬上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone has to go up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.63,1:11:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,手动关掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And shut it down manually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.60,1:11:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.97,1:11:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可是谁会去呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.24,1:11:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.61,1:11:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我非去不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.54,1:11:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.08,1:11:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,让他去吧这事注定得让他来做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go. Your grandfather has to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.19,1:12:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你把我放了 瓦伦丁 但是太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for freeing me, Valentin, but it's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.66,1:12:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也阻止不了我就算你也不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing can stop me. Not even you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.36,1:12:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没错只有你能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true. Only you can do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.77,1:12:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你出卖了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You double-crossed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.90,1:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,特工组织 你的同事还有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agency, your fellow agents, and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.27,1:12:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你的错误让我赔上一双腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mistake cost me my legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.84,1:12:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,像那种错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a mistake like that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.04,1:12:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只会把人推入更黑暗的深渊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could only push someone further into the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.98,1:12:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,的确如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.82,1:12:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看看现在的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.32,1:12:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在游戏世界中我把腿还给了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave you back your legs in the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.32,1:12:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了你才那么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did that for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.42,1:12:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,让我告诉你我一生中错过的事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you all the things I've missed in my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.86,1:12:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你导致的意外事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because of the accident you caused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.70,1:12:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能和妻子一起在海滩散步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't walk on the beach with my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.37,1:12:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我错过了我女儿的出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed my daughter's birth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.14,1:12:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,和她的婚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.01,1:13:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还要我继续说下去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I continue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.75,1:13:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.18,1:13:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.88,1:13:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在让我告诉你伴随而来的好处吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let me tell you all the good things that came of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.19,1:13:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谦虚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.82,1:13:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,充满灵性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spirituality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.76,1:13:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谅解别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.13,1:13:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这些年来你一直生活在畏惧我之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been living in fear of me all these years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.90,1:13:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但我只好一直寻找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've only been searching for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.50,1:13:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我才能对你说"我原谅你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I could tell you that I forgive you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.34,1:13:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有作梦才会听到你说那样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only dreamed I would hear you say something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.88,1:13:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,现在问题是你能原谅你自己吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the question is, can you forgive yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.18,1:13:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,犹未晚也塞巴斯汀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's never too late, Sebastian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.55,1:13:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来慢慢做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your time. Take your time to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.82,1:13:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有大约十秒钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have about 10 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.60,1:13:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.57,1:14:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.07,1:14:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼快离开那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni, get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.16,1:14:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.11,1:14:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.95,1:14:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,谁赢了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who won?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.48,1:14:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不在于你赢还是输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not whether you win or lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.35,1:14:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在于你怎么玩这个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's how you play the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.16,1:14:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,敬家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.76,1:14:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,敬家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To family.{\r}
